{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Super Miaoyin&quot; is a 3D hardcore platformer crafted by a solo developer. You will play as a cartoon-style Miaoyin, ascending the divine tree in a vibrant, fresh art style while embarking on a perilous journey.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Background</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the  forests of the Pure Land, there lives a divine bird named Super Miaoyin. This little Miaoyin is adorned with vibrant, colorful feathers and eyes that gleam with wisdom. Whenever a gentle breeze passes, it naturally emits harmonious and melodious sounds. Legend has it that the Miaoyin birds can sing beautiful songs even while still in their eggs. The song of Little Miaoyin flows like clear spring water through the heart, and whispers like a soft breeze across the face, leaving everyone who hears it in awe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, Little Miaoyin had an epiphany\uff1a &quot;Where does the most beautiful sound truly lie?&quot; it wondered. &quot;Perhaps I need some fresh inspiration!&quot; it thought to itself. Thus, Little Miaoyin decided to leave the familiar forest and embark on a wondrous journey of self-discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481480/extras/756ce4bce2f379dab94cc536eb54ffe1.poster.avif?t=1757561097\" width=700 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481480/extras/756ce4bce2f379dab94cc536eb54ffe1.webm?t=1757561097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481480/extras/756ce4bce2f379dab94cc536eb54ffe1.mp4?t=1757561097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every jump tests your nerve and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481480/extras/0ad81f8eb3af03980220157868a50abe.poster.avif?t=1757561097\" width=700 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481480/extras/0ad81f8eb3af03980220157868a50abe.webm?t=1757561097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481480/extras/0ad81f8eb3af03980220157868a50abe.mp4?t=1757561097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Miaoyin offers tight controls\u2014professional players have completed the game in under 2 hours during testing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481480/extras/c06af96b8b0cbb970b4a886e4add1143.poster.avif?t=1757561097\" width=700 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481480/extras/c06af96b8b0cbb970b4a886e4add1143.webm?t=1757561097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481480/extras/c06af96b8b0cbb970b4a886e4add1143.mp4?t=1757561097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;This is an adventure crafted solely for you\u2014 a symphony of flight and fall, a journey of courage and transcendence!&quot;</i>\u00a0</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Barrier Climbed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3481480/d72db1981b20a8e08d906f1da325fded29835dd5.jpg"},{"name":"Dawn of Survival","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3481480/6cdc8658f98aa78b0e323bdf43ac3c06a448b5f2.jpg"},{"name":"Ancient Tree Aw